{"id":"n28431-1-9","stage":3,"title":"내부 · 里面","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28431-1-9-1","ko":"집이 좀 좁아 보이는데요?","zh":"房子看起来有点窄吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집이","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집이","audio":"/audio/0f403a24bdd427c70421.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"좁아","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좁아","audio":"/audio/5ac1e7b088902135e848.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는데요?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는데요","audio":"/audio/8bd45ec0e935b42f825b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄，狭窄","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"路的宽度或物体与物体间的距离较短。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/400a9249ed935d9ef2ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28431-1-9-2","ko":"밖에서 보기에는 좁아 보여도 실제 내부는 넓습니다.","zh":"虽然从外面看显得窄，但实际上内部很宽敞。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밖에서","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에서","audio":"/audio/b5f2e1d501f86ee19da3.mp3"}},{"text":"보기에는","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보기에는","audio":"/audio/4818d84aadbd26ae6c78.mp3"}},{"text":"좁아","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좁아","audio":"/audio/5ac1e7b088902135e848.mp3"}},{"text":"보여도","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여도","audio":"/audio/9142e617884b2c18280d.mp3"}},{"text":"실제","meaning":"实际，实际上","explanation":"실제：实际，实际上","readings":[{"term":"실제","audio":"/audio/674150f61887a603ffc5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14110","senseId":"1","lemma":"실제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실제","audio":"/audio/674150f61887a603ffc5.mp3"}},{"text":"내부는","m